# This file is OPTIONAL now. Uniware needs NOTHING from here:
#   - Users log in through the app's UI with their own credentials.
#   - The tenant URL is hardcoded in uniware_client.py.
#   - Facilities are hardcoded in app.py (FACILITIES list).
#
# The only thing that may still use env is BigQuery logging, which needs a
# Google credential. You can either run `gcloud auth application-default
# login` on the machine, OR point at a service-account key below. If you use
# gcloud ADC, you don't need this file at all.
#
# Copy to .env and fill in LOCALLY if needed. NEVER commit .env.

# --- BigQuery (logging) ---
# These have sensible defaults baked into bq_logger.py; override only if needed.
# BQ_PROJECT=zouk-wh
# BQ_DATASET=MapleMonk
# BQ_TABLE=zouk_facility_switch_log

# Path to a Google service-account key file, if not using gcloud ADC.
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/path/to/service-account.json
